      "title": "王令媛墓誌",
      "paragraph_id": "c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "氏，父澄，假黃鉞太傅任城文宣王。妃姓王，諱令媛，琅邪臨沂人，齊尚書僕射奐之曾孫也。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
